     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In the case where an HTTP precondition is not satisfied, an appropriately typed exception should be thrown instead of the general \"WebApplicationException\".",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "A new exception type (PreconditionException?) should be introduced here:",
